Compilation Instructions

==== Install SPOT ====

0.1 Make sure SPOT is installed. SPOT can be found at:
    https://spot.lrde.epita.fr/index.html

==== Install MINISAT ====

0.2 Make sure MINISAT is installed.:
    sudo apt-get install minisat

==== Install SSyftHorn ====

1. Compile using the makefile:
   make


==== Run SSyftHorn ====

1. Run:
   ./SSyftHorn formulafile partfile
